<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101844" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχετ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for holding firm, retentive</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.428d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				725b
			</span></i>: abs., ib.<i><span class="en">
				952b
			</span></i>; <i>stable, permanent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τυπώσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					2.229
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>relative</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.11
			</span></i> P. Adv.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				131
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>depending on a</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχέσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.1
				</span></i>
			, <i>temporary</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρετός</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκτικός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.533
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>as the result of precarious conditions</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ ἕξεως καὶ διαθέσεως</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.129
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.43
			</span></i>.</div>
